    {
      "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-protection-of-information-act-2021-sch-1-sec-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4 After subsection 6D(3)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-protection-of-information-act-2021#sch-1-sec-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "royal-commissions-amendment-protection-of-information-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "royal-commissions-amendment-protection-of-information-act-2021.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(3A) A direction under subsection (3) may be given:\n\n(a) if the direction is given at an authorised member hearing of\nthe Commission—either by:\n\n(i) the President or Chair of the Commission (unless the\nPresident or Chair is not the member, or one of the\nmembers, of the Commission holding the hearing); or\n\n(ii) the member, or all of the members, of the Commission\nholding the hearing; or\n\n(b) if the Commission is constituted by 2 or more members and\nthe direction is not given at an authorised member hearing of\nthe Commission—either by:\n\n(i) the President or Chair of the Commission; or\n\n(ii) a majority of the members of the Commission; or\n\n(c) if the Commission is constituted by a sole Commissioner—\nby the sole Commissioner.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(3A) A direction under subsection (3) may be given:\n\n(a) if the direction is given at an authorised member hearing of\nthe Commission—either by:\n\n(i) the President or Chair of the Commission (unless the\nPresident or Chair is not the member, or one of the\nmembers, of the Commission holding the hearing); or\n\n(ii) the member, or all of the members, of the Commission\nholding the hearing; or\n\n(b) if the Commission is constituted by 2 or more members and\nthe direction is not given at an authorised member hearing of\nthe Commission—either by:\n\n(i) the President or Chair of the Commission; or\n\n(ii) a majority of the members of the Commission; or\n\n(c) if the Commission is constituted by a sole Commissioner—\nby the sole Commissioner.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-protection-of-information-act-2021-sch-1-sec-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-protection-of-information-act-2021-sch-1-sec-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "491e69bf5a12fb17c1bc0ee4bbf7a424801a0bbfd381693a3f7bc042aad6b338",
      "skos:note": "Direction under subsection (3) may be given by certain individuals or groups."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-protection-of-information-act-2021#sch-1-sec-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4 After subsection 6D(3)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(3A) A direction under subsection (3) may be given:\n\n(a) if the direction is given at an authorised member hearing of\nthe Commission—either by:\n\n(i) the President or Chair of the Commission (unless the\nPresident or Chair is not the member, or one of the\nmembers, of the Commission holding the hearing); or\n\n(ii) the member, or all of the members, of the Commission\nholding the hearing; or\n\n(b) if the Commission is constituted by 2 or more members and\nthe direction is not given at an authorised member hearing of\nthe Commission—either by:\n\n(i) the President or Chair of the Commission; or\n\n(ii) a majority of the members of the Commission; or\n\n(c) if the Commission is constituted by a sole Commissioner—\nby the sole Commissioner."
    },
