    {
      "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-protection-of-information-act-2021-sch-1-sec-6op-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6OP(5) Protection of certain information given to the Disability Royal",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-protection-of-information-act-2021#sch-1-sec-6op-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "royal-commissions-amendment-protection-of-information-act-2021.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "royal-commissions-amendment-protection-of-information-act-2021.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(5) A reference in subparagraph (1)(b)(ii) to experiences of systemic\nviolence, abuse, neglect or exploitation is a reference to\nexperiences, or an awareness, of a policy, procedure, practice, act\nor omission that contributed, or may have contributed, to a natural\nperson experiencing violence, abuse, neglect or exploitation.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A reference in subparagraph (1)(b)(ii) to experiences of systemic\nviolence, abuse, neglect or exploitation is a reference to\nexperiences, or an awareness, of a policy, procedure, practice, act\nor omission that contributed, or may have contributed, to a natural\nperson experiencing violence, abuse, neglect or exploitation.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-protection-of-information-act-2021-sch-1-sec-6op"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:royal-commissions-amendment-protection-of-information-act-2021-sch-1-sec-6op-ss-5-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c9727312baf3cf9275ff2b2191692757f0aa556111c9a364db0e96ebe7e7e961",
      "skos:note": "Reference to experiences of systemic violence, abuse, neglect or exploitation is a reference to experiences or awareness of a policy, procedure, practice, act or omission that contributed or may have contributed."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/royal-commissions-amendment-protection-of-information-act-2021#sch-1-sec-6op-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6OP(5) Protection of certain information given to the Disability Royal",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "(5) A reference in subparagraph (1)(b)(ii) to experiences of systemic\nviolence, abuse, neglect or exploitation is a reference to\nexperiences, or an awareness, of a policy, procedure, practice, act\nor omission that contributed, or may have contributed, to a natural\nperson experiencing violence, abuse, neglect or exploitation."
    },
